WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.079
Meta's glasses are getting an AI that buys
what you see. Who pays when you look?

00:00:06.829 --> 00:00:09.829
Its own terms: the losses are yours.

00:00:10.579 --> 00:00:13.579
And some buys can't be undone.

00:00:14.229 --> 00:00:16.943
Looking is free*. *Terms apply.
